1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:09,500
Assalam o Alaikum! Restaurant mein sirf khana nahi bikta — peeche chawal, chicken aur oil ka stock bhi kharch hota hai.

2
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:18,785
NestPOS mein recipe bana dein, to har sale par saman ka stock khud-ba-khud minus hota hai. Aaiye dekhte hain.

3
00:00:20,692 --> 00:00:28,646
Menu se Ingredients kholen. Yahan kitchen ka har kachcha saman darj hai — chawal, chicken aur oil.

4
00:00:28,646 --> 00:00:36,600
Har item ka rate, maujooda stock aur kam-se-kam limit hoti hai. Stock limit se neeche jaye to card khud khabardar karta hai.

5
00:00:38,501 --> 00:00:47,187
Naya saman add karna asaan hai — Add Ingredient dabayein.

6
00:00:47,187 --> 00:00:55,872
Naam Tamatar, unit kg, rate nabbe rupay, stock bees kg aur limit paanch. Save — ho gaya darj.

7
00:00:57,772 --> 00:01:05,961
Ab recipe — menu se Recipes kholen. Beef Pulao ki recipe dekhein.

8
00:01:05,961 --> 00:01:14,150
Ek plate mein pao kilo chawal aur pachaas gram oil. Isi hisaab se system jaanta hai ke kitna saman kharch hua.

9
00:01:16,052 --> 00:01:25,313
Ab kamaal dekhein. Sale screen se ek Beef Pulao bechte hain — CASH.

10
00:01:25,313 --> 00:01:34,573
Ingredients par wapas — Basmati Chawal ka stock khud pao kilo kam ho gaya. Na register, na ginti — system khud hisaab rakhta hai.

11
00:01:36,473 --> 00:01:44,427
To bas ek baar recipes bana dein — phir har plate ke saath saman ka hisaab khud hota rahega,

12
00:01:44,427 --> 00:01:52,381
aur khatam hone se pehle khabar bhi mil jayegi. KDS aur tables ki videos bhi dekhein. Shukriya!